OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan for former Cadent site
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 195 homes are set to be
OL,7,Fapproved at the former headquarters of
OL,8,FCadent in Hinckley.
OL,10,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council
OL,11,Fis recommended to approve a planning
OL,12,Fapplication on Tuesday from Cadent to
OL,13,Fbuild the development on land at Brick
OL,14,FKiln Street.
OL,16,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,17,F(LDRS) said Cadent once employed about
OL,18,F1,000 people at the site, before
OL,19,Fannouncing in 2021 it would close its
OL,20,Foperation in Hinckley and relocate to a
OL,21,Fnew site near Coventry.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
