OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan for former Cadent site
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report submitted as part of the
OL,7,Fplanning application states the
OL,8,Fproposals would make a "contribution"
OL,9,Ftowards housing need in the area and
OL,10,Fredevelop a "vacant brownfield site".
